# Repo Map

- `apps/web`: Next.js App Router UI, shadcn-style components, TanStack Query data fetching, React Hook Form scenario launcher.
- `apps/api`: NestJS API, Prisma schema/migrations, Prometheus endpoint at `/metrics`, Loki push, Sentry-compatible event capture.
- `infra`: Docker Compose dependencies plus Grafana, Loki, and Prometheus provisioning.
- `services/loki-viewer`: lightweight HTML viewer backed by Loki queries.
- `services/sentry-sink`: local Sentry-compatible event sink and inbox UI.
- `.cursor`: project AI layer. Keep it scoped, concrete, and context-efficient.
